# Claude / Claude Code - Net.Coffee COMPLETE + shared dependencies (ALL-IN-ONE) for Loon
# Source: https://ip.net.coffee/claude/site.html (reviewed 2026-10-09)
# Additional primary-source checks: https://code.claude.com/docs/en/network-config
# Loon remote rule: one rule per line, with NO policy column.
# Bind a single fixed proxy/policy in [Remote Rule] settings.
# WARNING: shared third-party domains and DOMAIN-KEYWORD rules may affect other applications.

# 01 | Net.Coffee: 7 core domain suffixes; includes api/mcp/console/workbench.anthropic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anthropic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,clau.de
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudemcpclient.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudemcpcontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudeusercontent.com

# 02 | Additional coverage outside Net.Coffee explicit lists
# claude.app: official Anthropic desktop documentation
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.app
# claude.dev: geosite:anthropic classical source
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.dev
# claude.site: Anthropic-owned host referenced by platform.claude.com (observed 2026-10-09)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.site

# 03 | Net.Coffee: CDN and static assets
# cdn.anthropic.com is already matched by DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anthropic.com
DOMAIN,servd-anthropic-website.b-cdn.net
DOMAIN,anthropic.com.cdn.cloudflare.net

# 04 | Net.Coffee: login and content
DOMAIN,anthropic.auth0.com
DOMAIN,anthropic-com.ghost.io
# hCaptcha on claude.ai/login (observed 2026-10-09); shared with other sites using hCaptcha
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hcaptcha.com
# "Continue with Google" sign-in; WARNING: ALL Google sign-ins on this device will use this policy
DOMAIN,accounts.google.com

# 05 | Net.Coffee: monitoring and product telemetry
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sentry.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,statsigapi.net
# Statsig API (api.statsig.com), per ConnersHua/RuleGo AI.list
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,statsig.com
DOMAIN,browser-intake-us5-datadoghq.com
# This additional Datadog hostname is in official Anthropic network requirements:
DOMAIN,http-intake.logs.us5.datadoghq.com

# 06 | Net.Coffee: third-party widgets and traffic statistics
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,intercom.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,intercomcdn.com
DOMAIN,cdn.usefathom.com

# 07 | Net.Coffee: catchall keywords (affect OTHER apps, too)
# The website's monitoring TABLE includes sentry; its copy-paste text omits it.
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,datadog
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,sentry
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,sift

# 09 | Optional shared dependencies (merged from Claude_Loon_MAX_ExtraServices.list)
# WARNING: GitHub/npm/Google/CDN traffic from ALL apps will use this policy.
DOMAIN,storage.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,registry.npmjs.org
DOMAIN,raw.githubusercontent.com
DOMAIN,github.com
DOMAIN,formulae.brew.sh
# Gerrit change lookup (*-review.googlesource.com) for Claude Desktop Code tab on googlesource.com checkouts.
# Loon has no mid-label wildcard, so this suffix also matches all other googlesource.com hosts (e.g. Android/Chromium source).
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googlesource.com
# Optional artifact web fonts and libraries: may redirect unrelated app traffic.
DOMAIN,fonts.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,fonts.gstatic.com
DOMAIN,cdnjs.cloudflare.com
DOMAIN,cdn.jsdelivr.net
DOMAIN,cdn.tailwindcss.com
DOMAIN,code.jquery.com
DOMAIN,unpkg.com
# www.anthropic.com runs on Webflow (observed 2026-10-09); shared by ALL Webflow-hosted sites
DOMAIN,cdn.prod.website-files.com
DOMAIN,d3e54v103j8qbb.cloudfront.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hubspotonwebflow.com

# 08 | Net.Coffee: IPv4 / IPv6 / ASN fallback; no-resolve only matches already-known IP destinations
IP-CIDR,160.79.104.0/21,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2607:6bc0::/32,no-resolve
IP-ASN,399358,no-resolve
# (IP fallback is placed last: domain rules match first)

# NTP note: geosite:category-ntp is not a native Loon rule.
# Optional separately maintained NTP Loon-compatible ruleset:
# https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MetaCubeX/meta-rules-dat/meta/geo/geosite/classical/category-ntp.list
# NTP uses UTC and cannot reveal timezone; route NTP separately ONLY if required.
